; The inverse rate when a pair is priced several times on one day, a zero among them. Each commodity ZA..ZK is held
; once and valued in EUR through the inverse of the prices of EUR in it.
2026-01-01 open Assets:Held
2026-01-01 open Equity:Other

; a price, then zero, on one day: that day gives no inverse, and there is no other
2026-01-02 price EUR 4 ZA
2026-01-02 price EUR 0 ZA
; zero, then a price: the price counts
2026-01-02 price EUR 0 ZB
2026-01-02 price EUR 4 ZB
; a price, zero, a price: the last one counts
2026-01-02 price EUR 4 ZC
2026-01-02 price EUR 0 ZC
2026-01-02 price EUR 8 ZC
; zero, a price, zero: no inverse
2026-01-02 price EUR 0 ZD
2026-01-02 price EUR 4 ZD
2026-01-02 price EUR 0 ZD
; a price, and zero the next day: the price stays the latest inverse
2026-01-02 price EUR 4 ZE
2026-01-03 price EUR 0 ZE
; a price, then a later day with a price and zero: the earlier day's inverse stays
2026-01-02 price EUR 5 ZF
2026-01-04 price EUR 4 ZF
2026-01-04 price EUR 0 ZF
; a price and zero, then a price on a later day: no rate until that day
2026-01-02 price EUR 4 ZG
2026-01-02 price EUR 0 ZG
2026-01-05 price EUR 8 ZG
; two prices, then zero, on one day: no inverse
2026-01-02 price EUR 4 ZI
2026-01-02 price EUR 8 ZI
2026-01-02 price EUR 0 ZI
; written out of date order: on 01-04 the price written last is 4, so it counts from that day
2026-01-04 price EUR 0 ZJ
2026-01-02 price EUR 5 ZJ
2026-01-04 price EUR 4 ZJ
; out of date order again: on 01-04 the price written last is zero, so 01-02 stays
2026-01-04 price EUR 4 ZK
2026-01-02 price EUR 5 ZK
2026-01-04 price EUR 0 ZK

2026-01-01 * "hold"
  Assets:Held   1 ZA
  Assets:Held   1 ZB
  Assets:Held   1 ZC
  Assets:Held   1 ZD
  Assets:Held   1 ZE
  Assets:Held   1 ZF
  Assets:Held   1 ZG
  Assets:Held   1 ZI
  Assets:Held   1 ZJ
  Assets:Held   1 ZK
  Equity:Other -1 ZA
  Equity:Other -1 ZB
  Equity:Other -1 ZC
  Equity:Other -1 ZD
  Equity:Other -1 ZE
  Equity:Other -1 ZF
  Equity:Other -1 ZG
  Equity:Other -1 ZI
  Equity:Other -1 ZJ
  Equity:Other -1 ZK
